ck but you could see it  Knight to f3 here just stopping the  Queen from ever coming down here because  this sets it up for me at least to  castle on the King side on the next move  if you want to if they now try to pin  down material you could just play d4  controlling the center of the board same  thing is if they play something like  Knight to c6 you could play d4  controlling that's fine as well but that  is the Bishop's gambit from the King's  gambit accepted line so if you do like  to play the King's game and hopefully  you do since it's my favorite opening in  chess and you play a lot of the knight  to f3 go ahead and try out the bishops  game but let me know what you guys think  I've had a lot of fun playing it myself  but until next time thank you guys for  watching I'll see you in the next video
 

